#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:3
msgid "计算图"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:5
msgid "什么是计算图？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:7
msgid "计算图是一种用图来表示数学运算的方法。你可以把它想象成**数据流的管道系统**：数据从输入节点流入，经过各种操作节点（如加法、乘法、激活函数），最终到达输出节点。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:9
#, python-brace-format
msgid "这种表示方式有两个核心价值 {cite}`werbos1990backpropagation`："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:11
msgid "**可视化**：复杂的数学表达式变成清晰的流程图"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:12
msgid "**自动求导**：为反向传播提供结构基础，让梯度计算自动化"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:15
msgid "计算图示例：$f(x,y) = (x+y) \\times y$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:38
msgid "在这个图中："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:40
msgid "**蓝色节点**：输入变量（$x$, $y$）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:41
msgid "**红色节点**：操作（加法 $+$、乘法 $\\times$）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:42
msgid "**绿色节点**：最终输出"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:43
msgid "**箭头**：数据流动方向"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:45
msgid "前向传播：数据如何流动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:47
msgid "前向传播就是数据从输入节点流向输出节点的过程。按照拓扑顺序（先计算依赖的节点），每个操作节点接收输入、计算输出。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:49
msgid "示例：计算 $f(x, y, z) = (x + y) \\times z$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:51
msgid "设 $x = 2$, $y = 3$, $z = 4$："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:53
msgid "**输入节点**：$x = 2$, $y = 3$, $z = 4$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:54
msgid "**加法节点**：$a = x + y = 2 + 3 = 5$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:55
msgid "**乘法节点**：$f = a \\times z = 5 \\times 4 = 20$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:57
msgid "这就是计算图在前向传播中的工作流程。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:59
msgid "反向传播：梯度如何回流"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:61
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"计算图的真正威力在于{ref}`back-"
"propagation`。梯度（误差信号）沿着边的反方向流动，从输出节点传回输入节点。这使得我们可以高效计算每个参数对最终损失的贡献。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:63
msgid "关键洞察"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:66
msgid "计算图让\"信用分配\"变得系统化："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:67
msgid "前向传播：数据沿着箭头方向流动，计算输出"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:68
msgid "反向传播：梯度沿着箭头反方向流动，分摊误差"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:71
msgid "PyTorch中的动态计算图"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:73
msgid "PyTorch使用**动态计算图**（define-by-run）：每次前向传播时实时构建计算图，这提供了极大的灵活性。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:75
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"import torch\n"
"\n"
"# 创建张量并启用梯度跟踪\n"
"x = torch.tensor(2.0, requires_grad=True)\n"
"y = torch.tensor(3.0, requires_grad=True)\n"
"z = torch.tensor(4.0, requires_grad=True)\n"
"\n"
"# 构建计算图（前向传播）\n"
"a = x + y      # 加法操作\n"
"f = a * z      # 乘法操作\n"
"\n"
"print(f\"前向传播: f = {f}\")  # 输出: 20.0\n"
"\n"
"# 反向传播：自动计算梯度\n"
"f.backward()\n"
"\n"
"print(f\"\\n梯度计算:\")\n"
"print(f\"∂f/∂x = {x.grad}\")  # 输出: 4.0 (z的值)\n"
"print(f\"∂f/∂y = {y.grad}\")  # 输出: 4.0 (z的值)\n"
"print(f\"∂f/∂z = {z.grad}\")  # 输出: 5.0 (a的值)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:98
msgid "梯度计算的解释"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:100
msgid "为什么梯度是这些值？根据链式法则："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:102
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x} = \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial a} "
"\\cdot \\frac{\\partial a}{\\partial x} = z \\cdot 1 = 4$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:103
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y} = \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial a} "
"\\cdot \\frac{\\partial a}{\\partial y} = z \\cdot 1 = 4$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:104
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial z} = a = 5$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/computational-graph.md:106
msgid "PyTorch的 `backward()` 自动完成了这些计算。"
msgstr ""

